            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this review article autor is discussing the ortopaedic causes of joint pain and limping in children. The paper presents orthopaedic diseases typical for the child's age. The attention was put on the possibilities of rare diseases including tumors and tumorlike conditions of bone which implies on the noncharacteristic symptoms.</AbstractText>
